1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:07,233
Inside the gate: a stone tunnel, a
steel table, and a guard named Ollie
who has given this speech ten thousand
times.

2
00:00:07,933 --> 00:00:10,433
Name? Where from? How many days on the
road?

3
00:00:11,133 --> 00:00:15,433
Just call me the man from the ninth
floor. Maple Street. Forty days.

4
00:00:16,133 --> 00:00:22,167
Forty days on a bicycle. With that
cough. Hand over the hatchet, the
knife, and whatever else you're
hiding.

5
00:00:22,867 --> 00:00:29,033
Rule two. Weapons stay at the gate.
You get a numbered token. You get
everything back when you leave.

6
00:00:29,733 --> 00:00:31,500
Your token is number sixty-seven.

7
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:35,700
Sixty-seven. Everybody's favorite.
Welcome to Brightwall.
